WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:06.750
On that day, like what all passionate soccer players yearn for,

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:11.020
we stood on the pitch of FC Barcelona's Camp Nou.

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:19.670
There, by playing our own unique brand of soccer,

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:22.470
we shocked the whole world!{and we shall shock the world! }

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:01.530
Hey, did you hear? A transfer student is coming.

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:03.200
Really? Is it a girl?

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:04.240
How would I know?

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:06.310
You both love soccer, right?

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:07.440
Yes!

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:09.640
Is that the transfer student?

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:13.250
You'll definitely find a great coach with that spirit.

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:15.780
That's what she said...

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:15.150
Rise!

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.680
But what should I do?

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.180
Rise!

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:18.720
Rise!

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:19.590
Yes!

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:22.350
Oota-kun, class has started already.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:23.320
I'm sorry!

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:26.290
Oh?

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.560
Erika-chan!?

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:28.460
Shou-kun!?

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.360
You go to this school?

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:32.130
Wow, that surprised me.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.670
Do you know him?

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:34.770
I guess.

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:37.270
What? Your girlfriend?

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:40.140
A girl from Kansai, too! Woo-hoo!

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:41.770
No!

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:42.980
Don't lie.

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:44.740
You're red from ear to ear!

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:49.950
Hey, everyone. Quiet down.

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:51.480
Quiet down!

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:52.920
Shut up!

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:57.860
T-Takatou-san?

00:02:57.860 --> 00:02:59.290
Sorry about that.

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:00.260
Hey, you!

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:01.160
Me?

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:01.760
Yeah!

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:04.830
I'm from Osaka, not Kansai!

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:08.370
Don't mix them up!

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:09.270
Okay.

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:10.040
Good.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:13.270
I'm Takatou Erika.

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:15.570
I'm from Namba, Osaka.

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:18.980
I love soccer more than eating!

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:20.710
Yes, yes, my favorite player is...

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:21.810
Oota Shou!

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:23.580
Correct!{Yes! }

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:24.480
As if!{Just kidding! }

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:30.560
I love Real Madrid's Cristiano Ronaldo-sama!

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:34.630
Let me tell you that the difference between
 Ronaldo-sama and Shou-kun is like night and day!

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:39.470
No, it's more like the height difference between the Tokyo Sky Tree and a furnace chimney!

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:41.500
That's pretty amazing...

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:42.600
Sorry about that. {True friends indeed}

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:46.140
In any case, nice to meet all of you!

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:48.310
Uh, your seat will be...

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:51.180
Sensei! The seat beside Reika-chan is free!

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:53.350
You're right.

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:55.410
Why so close to Shou-kun?

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.780
Please sit next to Saionji-san.

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:58.780
Okay.

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:02.390
So you're Reika-chan? Nice to meet you.

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:04.660
Nice to meet you too, Takatou-san.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:05.860
Just call me Erika.

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:10.030
Why didn't you tell me that you were transferring here?

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:11.830
You never asked.

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:12.770
Jeez.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:15.000
Oh yeah! Actually-

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:19.240
Oota-kun, I know you're quite happy to have your girlfriend transfer here,

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:20.370
but we're in the middle of class.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.840
Oh goodness.

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:25.880
You're loud even when you're not playing soccer.

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:32.280
Erika-chan! Let me show you around school-

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:36.020
No thanks. I don't want any more weird rumors.

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:38.920
Reika-chan, can you show me around?

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:39.690
Eh?

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:40.730
Please!

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.730
Sure.

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:44.430
Thanks!

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.700
Let's go, let's go!

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:46.900
O-Okay.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:51.200
This is the staff room, and right 
next to it is the principal's office.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:52.770
The infirmary is around the back.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:54.970
The gym is across the hall.

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:58.910
I see. It's similar to my old school, so I can remember all this easily.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:04:59.780
Thank goodness.

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:05.620
I should be saying that! I'm really lucky to 
have made a nice friend like you, Reika-chan.

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:06.890
Really?

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:09.660
I'm really happy to hear that.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.560
Wow, so cute!

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:16.960
I'm really happy to be your friend, too.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:17.860
Really?

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:21.970
Yep! You're cheerful and very frank with the guys as well.

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:23.400
I'm jealous.

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:28.270
Well, I'm always surrounded by idiotic boys, so I'm used to it. {Shou-kun ka, ohimesama?}

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:30.740
You play soccer?

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.710
Erika-chan?

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:39.120
I see. Shou-kun's team, too.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:41.120
That manager was disgusting!

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:43.920
"Two players can't do anything?"

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:47.390
Shou-kun's doing his best.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:51.330
I was the ace on my old team.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:52.660
Oh? Wow!

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:58.400
I've always been very fast, so
 everyone called me the Speed Star.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.970
Go, Erika!

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:02.770
Go!

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:09.780
You're so cool.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:12.350
But you can level up a lot more.

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:17.020
Erika-chan, you don't lose against guys, too.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:23.260
Sorry, I said something unnecessary.

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:25.260
No, it's okay.

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:28.670
Ah! Found you!

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:31.670
You were over there? I looked all over!

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:33.340
What do you want?{What do you want? }{Slight readjustment to fit with next line}

00:06:33.340 --> 00:06:35.340
Nothing, really!{Nothing, really. }{Very liberal, but please replace if you can think upa better phrasing for this -sm}

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:37.880
I called Misaki-san yesterday!

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:39.080
What!?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:43.880
She asked us whether we want to go watch the New Tokyo Rosa's practice.

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:45.720
No way!

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:46.750
No way!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:47.450
No way!

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:50.320
What? You're louder than I am.

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.560
That's because you surprised me!{You surprised me! }

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:56.330
I know you have no tact, but you actually called her!

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:59.060
I told her we're going. Do you want me to cancel?

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:01.030
You idiot! Of course we're going!

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:03.170
It's this Saturday. You okay with that?

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:05.740
No problem!

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:10.040
Good morning!

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:11.280
Good morning.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.580
You're here a bit early.

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:15.750
I can see pros practising!{I can see a pro practice!}

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:18.120
I couldn't sleep at all!

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:20.520
Me, too! My eyes are all red.

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:30.400
Takatou doesn't seem so fast lately.

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:32.560
Yeah, you're faster.

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:34.330
Yeah, that's right.

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:37.040
We're taller than her, too.

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:39.400
She's a girl, that's why.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:44.440
You're a girl...

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.140
Isn't it time to give up?

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:50.180
No! No way I'm doing that!

00:07:57.890 --> 00:08:00.690
Who was the one that said he couldn't sleep at all?

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:04.460
He'll never understand my frustrations.

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:09.570
Wow!

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:11.240
Amazing!

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:13.010
So huge!

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:16.540
It's obvious, but that park is nothing compared to this.

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:20.250
Wow, they even have rubber pellets inside the artificial turf.

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:21.780
You're right.

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:22.710
You're here!

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:25.150
Good morning, Misaki-san!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:28.850
I told the people here already. You're free to wonder around.

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:30.790
Thank you very much!

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:32.620
Thank you for coming.

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:33.530
Yes!

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:36.500
They may let you take part in practice, too.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.560
Yes, that's what I want.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:41.630
Is that why you told me to suit up with sportswear?

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.970
You want me to look as tactless as you!?

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:48.070
Of course. Especially you.

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:59.990
The yellow uniform is for Rosa's second team, the young Girasols.{please double check this and next line, explanation seems slightly foggy to me... -sm}

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:03.260
The pink uniform is for the junior youth team, the Cosmos.

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:07.230
You know a lot. I thought you weren't interested in women's soccer.

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:09.630
Actually, I looked this up on the Internet yesterday.

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:10.960
I knew it.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:23.180
Trapping and passing... Just watching them makes me realize the difference in our levels.

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:28.150
I was too busy focusing on our game that time, but Misaki-san was really something.  {Check this line please. -sm}

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:31.680
Wow! They're really good!

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:34.890
This isn't my team, so it'll be quite hard to try and fit in.

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:40.360
The junior youths are about the same age as us, but they're amazing.

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:44.700
Why did you agree to this? This doesn't help us at all.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:49.700
Actually, I only wanted to thank her when I called.

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:50.600
But...

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:53.110
You want to make your own team, right?

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:54.340
Come watch.

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:56.140
Make sure you bring that girl along.

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:57.680
She told me to bring you along.

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:02.580
Hey, hey, hey! More!

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.380
What did you mean by that, Misaki-san?

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:06.790
W-Wait!

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:11.060
Since when did I become part of Shou-kun's team!?

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:16.290
Girasol and Rosa are about to play a game.

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:18.960
This will be good.

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:43.260
A Marseille Roulette!

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:45.760
But she's surrounded!

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:46.790
No.

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:54.800
Watch out behind you!

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.400
Okay! I'm clearing this!

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.310
Yes!

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:06.440
Wow! Too good! I also want to play on a team like that!

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:10.820
Erika!

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:23.460
It got a bit cold.

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:26.430
Give back my beautiful daydream!

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:29.000
Where's your jacket!?

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.140
Why are you so mad?

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:32.100
How was it?

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:35.310
What did you think of that mini game?

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:39.680
Everyone's so good! Especially the senior team!

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:43.420
What do you think is the difference 
between the Girasols and the Cosmos?

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:45.620
Their skill.

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:51.290
Ball-trapping, speed, accuracy, and pinpoint passing.

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:54.990
Well... That may be true.

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:57.760
I don't think that's all.

00:11:57.760 --> 00:11:58.660
What?

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:05.470
The senior team and the youth team have about-equal skills.

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:08.270
Their passing strengths may be a bit different,

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:10.180
but the main difference lies in the confidence.

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:12.240
What do you mean?

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:14.510
The Rosas have a wider field of vision.

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:18.350
They can see their teammates' movements.

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:21.550
So, they can tell when the defensive switches are coming.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:24.190
That's the difference, I think.

00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:27.990
You were watching pretty closely.

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:29.290
Really?

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:31.500
Come with me, you two.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.230
I wonder what she wants?

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.370
Wipe your nose, please!

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:40.340
Hello.

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:42.240
Please do some warm-ups.

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:45.640
You'll be appearing in the 
upcoming Girasol vs Cosmos match.

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.880
Okay, I understand-

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:50.020
Eh!?

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:50.020
Yes!

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:00.530
I said that they may let us practice,

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:03.190
but I never thought about appearing in a mini game.

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:05.200
We're lucky!

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:07.430
What are you thinking?

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:14.870
Looks like I'll just have to go along with it.

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:17.110
What? You nervous?

00:13:17.110 --> 00:13:18.210
Well...

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:21.910
I guess. But this is a good chance.

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:25.480
Try and see how well you can play with the Cosmos.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.090
You'll understand many things.

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:43.970
Who should I pass to?

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:45.500
Oh no!

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:52.980
They're coming!

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.980
Hey! Watch the players, not the ball!

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.150
O-Okay!

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:04.660
That player!

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:23.980
Yes!

00:14:24.810 --> 00:14:27.610
Damn! I was so close!

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:29.610
That kid...

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.550
It all started from my mistake.

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:38.060
But they sure don't hold back.

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:02.350
Watch out! Number 11 is coming!

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:08.850
Nice feint!

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:13.290
Yes!

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:14.890
Nice interception!

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:17.500
Move forward slowly! It starts now!

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:37.780
Erika-chan! Do a one-two with number 8!

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:48.060
Go!

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:51.930
You don't need to tell me that! I'm the Speed Star!

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:54.900
I won't lose in speed!

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:56.130
Yes! That's it!

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:20.120
Nice goal!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:22.460
Yes!

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:37.610
Nice goal.

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:38.910
Misaki-san!

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:41.150
You look exhausted.

00:16:41.150 --> 00:16:43.620
How was it, playing with the youth team?

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:45.620
I'm so mad.

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:49.920
But I'm also relieved, now that I know how big the difference is.

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:51.120
Really?

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:52.790
Do you need anything to drink, Shou-kun?

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:55.130
I finished them all.

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:58.130
I'll treat you. Go buy some drinks.

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:00.770
Okay! Thank you very much!

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:09.110
"Why do I still lose to the boys, 
even when I practice so much?"

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:12.940
How do I know what you're thinking?

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:16.580
Because I'm a female upperclassman.

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:20.080
Everyone here has walked the same path.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:25.320
They all have their own worries, but only they themselves can find the answer.

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:30.160
If you can't find your own answer, 
then just grit your teeth and run with it.

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:32.360
Just like Shou-kun.

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:37.670
He'll become someone more amazing than you can ever imagine.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:41.270
Don't worry. You can still level up a lot more.

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.680
Sorry for the wait.

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:46.080
Thanks!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:51.350
Oh yeah, we hold this kind of group practice about once a month.

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:55.150
Once you assemble eight members, do come again.

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:56.990
Really?

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:58.890
I got the approval from the coach.

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:01.090
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:06.660
It's not bad to play with the guys while you're still in elementary school.

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:10.440
Oh yeah! We still need a coach!

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.400
Please become our coach!

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.670
You idiot!

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:18.640
It's impossible. I can't imagine being on his team.

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:26.080
Who are they?

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:30.690
Amarillo. The elementary school team for New Tokyo FC.

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:33.090
Elementary school? That huge guy?

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:36.890
Yep. He's Kageura-kun, a sixth grader.

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:38.060
The same grade as me?

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:41.900
His team is amazing. They're the national champions.

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:46.940
Kageura-kun, for sure. He got the MVP award in fifth grade.

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:48.070
Really?

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:50.170
He's called the Emperor of Amarillo.

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:53.140
Emperor?

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:55.880
Hey, he's been staring at you.

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:57.280
Oh, really?

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:02.950
Hey, he's coming this way.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.290
Seems like it.

00:19:08.990 --> 00:19:11.000
Do you need something?

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.130
Are you from the Momoyama Predators?

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:15.970
Yes.

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:18.400
Are the Furuyas here?

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:21.410
No, they aren't.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:23.470
That's too bad.

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:27.650
Why couldn't we play your team last year?

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:30.150
You only had to win one more match.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:34.690
Tell the Furuyas that we want to play against them, be it in a practice match or anything.

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.090
Later.

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:39.720
Um... How did you know that I was on the Predators?

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:43.630
I saw you in the huddle before a match last year.

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:44.860
Yes.

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:48.130
I never forget what I see once.{I don't forget anyone I meet.}

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:52.500
Looks like he's amazing, in many ways.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.640
He's a sixth grader, just like the two of you.

00:19:54.640 --> 00:19:55.840
Don't lose in spirit!

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:56.810
Yes!

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:57.780
Do your best.

00:19:57.780 --> 00:19:59.240
Okay!

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:09.020
Today was a very interesting day.

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:17.500
We met someone amazing, too.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:19.560
He's a sixth grader, just like the two of you.

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:20.630
Don't lose in spirit!

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:24.140
Don't worry. You can still level up a lot more.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.140
I just have to do what I can.

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:30.070
Are the Furuyas here?

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:35.310
Hey, wake up! I have something to ask you.

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:39.680
The Furuyas?

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:42.550
They're the core of the Predators.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:45.320
They're known as the Triplet Demons.

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:47.490
Triplet Demons?

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:51.860
They're really good, but their personalities...

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:55.000
They got into a fight with the coach and left the team last winter.

00:20:55.930 --> 00:20:59.570
The manager was pissed off and the coach got fired.

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:03.470
Since the triplets left, the other players started leaving one by one.

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:06.140
I'm the only one left.

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:08.350
Are you listening?

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:10.920
If we grab the three of them, 
that'd leave only three more to go.

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:12.280
You aren't listening?

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:16.290
You heard Misaki-san, right? Gather eight members and we can go practice.

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:17.960
I did.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:20.090
We have to make them join!

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:23.900
You're right. They may get fired up with this.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.160
See?

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:26.030
You serious?

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:27.530
Yes!

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:32.000
Excuse me!

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:33.910
What's with this house?

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:38.140
Now I know what wealth disparity means.

00:21:38.140 --> 00:21:40.780
They're at the park, it seems.

00:21:56.690 --> 00:21:58.900
Yo, isn't that Shou-kun?

00:21:58.900 --> 00:22:00.970
Hey, long time no see.

00:22:00.970 --> 00:22:03.700
I have something to tell you three.

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:12.910
Can't you tell? We're in the middle of tennis practice.

00:22:12.910 --> 00:22:15.980
Can you just hear us out?

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:19.580
Shut up! You're disturbing us!

00:22:21.990 --> 00:22:24.790
What's with that attitude!?

00:22:37.240 --> 00:22:40.470
Not a bad shot for a girl.

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:49.980
Shou-kun!

00:22:55.490 --> 00:22:56.990
Y-You guys...

00:22:58.220 --> 00:23:01.990
So these are the Triplet Demons...{So you're the Triplet Demons...}

00:24:35.650 --> 00:24:37.620
Hey! What's with those three?

00:24:37.620 --> 00:24:38.790
The Furuyas?

00:24:38.790 --> 00:24:42.260
They're called the Triplet Demons, but they're really good at soccer!

00:24:42.260 --> 00:24:44.000
Their personalities are disgusting!

00:24:44.000 --> 00:24:47.930
Okay! Let's gather more members and revive the Momoyama Predators!

00:24:47.930 --> 00:24:49.070
Wait right there!

00:24:49.070 --> 00:24:50.570
The team name 
should be the Dandelions!

00:24:50.570 --> 00:24:54.010
Next episode of Ginga e
 Kickoff!! The Triplet Demons.
